mc-fdd (0.0.5-1) bullseye; urgency=medium

  * Pre-Depends on mc, so that mc is configured before this package is
    unpacked. Installing both in one go on a machine without mc left dpkg
    asking about the modified mc.ext.ini and the installation failed.
  * The generated files are written under the name they carry once mc-hdd has
    displaced them. Writing to the displaced name followed the symlink of
    mc-hdd, so on an upgrade the entries of mc-fdd were lost and the old ones
    came back from the copy mc-hdd had kept.

 -- Yauheni Kundo <e.kundo@gmail.com>  Mon, 03 Aug 2026 17:00:00 +0200

mc-fdd (0.0.4-1) bullseye; urgency=medium

  * ufdd carries the v06 disk format itself and no longer depends on the
    system diskdefs of cpmtools.
  * ufdd runs under bash: creating a user_N directory was broken under dash.
  * The mc.ext.ini entry escapes the regular expression the way mc expects it.

 -- Yauheni Kundo <e.kundo@gmail.com>  Mon, 03 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0200

